body:
I've transferred the `transformData` call to the `Template` component because it seemed logical to put it here. Does this work for you guys ?

On widgets with header and footer, `transformData` is only used for item right now. Should we also enable it on header and footer?

For `hits`, which is the only one with two `Template`s, here is the API:

``` js
transformData: {
  empty: function (data) { /* ... */ },
  hit: function (data) { /* ... */ }
}
```
